{"4078410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Europe2999", "steam_appid": 4078410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Europe2999 </strong>is a third-person shooter blending survival, storytelling, and total customization. Your mission: survive in a world where every faction wants to use you or crush you. Between back-alley deals, betrayals, and sudden battles, it’s up to you to write your legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed groups, shadowy cults, local militias, and foreign powers all fight for influence. In this fragile balance, one mistake can cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal survival:</strong> secure your treatment every two weeks, or face permanent death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tense and dangerous world:</strong> explore a Mediterranean island on the brink of collapse, caught between the European Union and rival powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced third-person action:</strong> intense combat with a wide arsenal and vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique character:</strong> race, gender, appearance, clothes, everything is customizable. Go further by creating and commanding your own army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decisive choices:</strong> your decisions in dialogue and missions reshape the course of the story. Will you topple the established order or defend the island’s fragile balance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From survivor to power figure:</strong> trafficker, warlord, or free agent, write your own destiny.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Europe2999 </strong>is a third-person shooter blending survival, storytelling, and total customization. Your mission: survive in a world where every faction wants to use you or crush you. Between back-alley deals, betrayals, and sudden battles, it’s up to you to write your legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed groups, shadowy cults, local militias, and foreign powers all fight for influence. In this fragile balance, one mistake can cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal survival:</strong> secure your treatment every two weeks, or face permanent death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tense and dangerous world:</strong> explore a Mediterranean island on the brink of collapse, caught between the European Union and rival powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced third-person action:</strong> intense combat with a wide arsenal and vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique character:</strong> race, gender, appearance, clothes, everything is customizable. Go further by creating and commanding your own army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decisive choices:</strong> your decisions in dialogue and missions reshape the course of the story. Will you topple the established order or defend the island’s fragile balance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From survivor to power figure:</strong> trafficker, warlord, or free agent, write your own destiny.</p>", "short_description": "Europe2999 is a third-person shooter mixing survival, narrative and full customization. On a tense Mediterranean island, secure your treatment, forge your legend, and decide the fate of a world on the brink of collapse.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078410/b50d33361bbaffa9a1ff0b61adfd4902f5639309/header.jpg?t=1787082451", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078410/911455d2554860735301c3d79e3acd3262fa339c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787082451", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/407